 "beatLines": [
  {
   "day": 12,
   "tag": "slot60",
   "text": "◈ THE TRIAL — the audience is restless. The System offers Gilberto a trial, broadcast live. Survive it and take the slot. Refuse it and... well. The audience remembers refusals. (Ability slots: 4)"
  },
  {
   "day": 12,
   "tag": "sentiment-lesson",
   "text": "◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will do the math. (It is not math. It is love. The System will never know.) Channel keepsakes from your pack."
  },
  {
   "day": 12,
   "tag": "demo",
   "text": "SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Photo Album. WATCH.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 12,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Photo Album and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Green Thumb)"
  },
  {
   "day": 13,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Photo Album and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Gossip Network)"
  },
  {
   "day": 14,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Photo Album and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Photosynthesis)"
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Photo Album and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Deep Reserves)"
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Photo Album. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Dispatcher's headset. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  }
